.el .ds Aq '
.TH stool-key 1  "stool-key "
.SH NAME
stool\-key \- Back up and restore GPG and SSH keys independently of dotfiles
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstool\-key\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Back up and restore GPG and SSH keys independently of dotfiles
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
stool\-key\-backup(1)
Create one password\-encrypted offline key backup outside Git workspaces
.TP
stool\-key\-restore(1)
Validate and manually restore an offline key backup
.TP
stool\-key\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
